{"version":1,"key":"quest:205","content":{"id":205,"title":"transition-behavior 的用法！","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:205","type":"quest","id":205},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"transition-behavior 让离散属性也支持过渡","meta":"","excerpt":"在 CSS 中，transition 只能对可插值的属性，比如 width、color、opacity 等这些进行平滑过渡，对于离散的属性，transition 无法进行平滑过渡，只会直接跳变，比如 display 属性，它的取值都是离散的，从一个值到另一个值，比如 none 和 block 之间的变化是立即发生的，中","target":{"key":"card:758","type":"card","id":758},"citeKey":"card:758"}],"trail":[{"time":1781140316122,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1781225153878,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1781228185881,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1781140316122,"updateTime":1781140316122,"resolvedTime":1781228185881},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1781140316122}}